msgstr "Docked"

#: assets/general_dialog.rml
msgid "As on the console's own screen: games draw 720p, which asks less of the computer."
msgstr "Net als op het consolescherm: games worden weergegeven in 720p, wat de computer minder belast."

#: assets/general_dialog.rml
